        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions SYN375DUOSAL, Aluminum Sutter Dual Ruler Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis incredible contemporarily designed door pull can be used in many applications such as: appliances, entrance doors, and even as a glass shower door pull. The Modern Dual Sutter Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions Sutter Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-STR07-specifications.pdf?v=1704262217\"><b>First Impressions SYN375DUOSAL Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>SYN375012DUOSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center: 11-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>SYN375024DUOSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 23-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>SYN375036DUOSAL:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 35-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Face Width: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Clearance: 1.63\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Modern Dual Sutter Pull",
                "description": "This incredible contemporarily designed door pull can be used in many applications such as: appliances, entrance doors, and even as a glass shower door pull. The Modern Dual Sutter Pull can be surface mounted, thru-bolt mounted, or back-to-back mounted on wood, fiberglass, glass, or metal doors. It is available in 12 inch, 24 inch, and 36 inch lengths. \r\n",
